 implant post, an abutment, and a prosthesis. After the dental implant post and\n\nJuly 12, 2023\n\n\n### What Happens If I Don’t Have A Bone Grafting Procedure Before My Dental Implants Are Placed?\n\n\nWhen people have had one or more missing teeth for a long period of time, then they may need a bone grafting procedure before they\n\nJune 12, 2023\n\n\n### After Getting A Full Arch Of Teeth Extracted, Should I Get Treated With Full Mouth Dental Implants?\n\n\nWhen people have a full arch of severely decayed or infected teeth, then they will want to go get those teeth extracted. After the damaged\n\nJune 10, 2023\n\n\n## When expertise meets technology, you get the highest standard of care.\n\n\nFind out what our implant dentist in Los Angeles can do for you today.\n\nCall Now\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Yelp Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddress:\n\n12301 Wilshire Blvd Suite 205,\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 481-0111\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDental Website by Progressive Dental Marketing",
